1. shout "hi"             -> "HI!"
2. shout("hi")            -> "HI!"
3. puts shout "hi"        -> prints HI!
4. shout = "quiet"; shout  -> "quiet"  (the local wins)
5. shout("hi")            -> "HI!"  (parentheses reach the method)
6. shout "hi"             -> "HI!"  (a bare name with an argument is a call)
7. self.shout("hi")       -> "HI!"  (a receiver reaches the method)
